    {
      "id": "claim_b145e32f5639429896ff25d0a654c0d7",
      "statement": "The four-domain dependency graph is acyclic: core depends on nothing within the project (stdlib only); api depends on core; cli depends on core and sync; sync depends on core only. cli does not depend on api; sync does not depend on cli or api; api does not depend on cli or sync.",
      "evidence": [
