      "statement": "The CLI builds an argparse parser with one subparser per subcommand; each subparser sets func to a handler in cli/commands.py, and main() creates a Store() and calls args.func(store, args). It registers 7 subcommands: add, list, remove, count, export, import, and tag-overlap.",
