    {
      "id": "claim_941feca5356a472dbd5406d0a538c329",
      "statement": "sync.exporter provides export_to_json (same JSON array format as Store's internal file, round-trippable by the importer) and export_to_markdown (groups bookmarks by tag, sorts tags alphabetically, places untagged bookmarks under a (无标签) section). count_by_tag provides a pre-export distribution preview.",
