      "statement": "The test suite is organized one file per domain under tests/, each using a temp-directory Store for isolation: test_core covers Bookmark round-trip, Store CRUD/next_id, tag normalization/counts, and tag_overlap AND semantics; test_api uses FastAPI TestClient with deps._store_singleton overridden; test_sync covers normalize_url, dedup_by_url, export round-trips, and import dedup-and-merge.",
